    "answer": "I do not know the date. I found no record of Otto ever having an \"off\" TMS mode, or of when one was removed. The sources I could search show that `TMS_MODE` currently accepts only `stand-in` or `live`. `config.ts` throws \"TMS_MODE must be stand-in or live.\" for anything else, and the Helm chart's `api.tmsMode` check rejects other values the same way. The stand-in mode came in with #399, and the stand-in TMS README says it stays until OLT sends a key (#401). I could not find a commit, PR or issue that removed an \"off\" value, so I can't give a date.",
